+@opindex mwiiu-tls
+@item -mwiiu-tls
+Use the Wii U module-resolver ABI for thread-local storage.  All TLS
+variables, including internal variables and initialization guards, use
+the global-dynamic model instead of a thread pointer in @code{r2}.
+This option does not change the selected CPU or ordinary data accesses.
+On embedded PowerPC targets, it also enables @option{-fuse-cxa-atexit}
+by default for C++ TLS destructor registration.  Use it with the WUT
+runtime and link specifications, which disable TLS linker relaxation.
+
